# Right-clicks are press-and-hold here (the DSL's click is the left button).
# Coordinates: IRICE-TEST 1920x1080, scale 1, the default Control Center layout
# (setup below resets it). Material grid: x0 1512, y0 50, columns 94 apart
# (86 wide), rows 80 apart (72 tall). Glass grid: x0 1560, y0 50, columns
# and rows 82.5 apart (72.5). Default layout rows: 0 Wi-Fi 2x1 + Now Playing
# 2x2; 1 Bluetooth, Night Light; 2 Focus 2x1, Stages, Dark Mode; 3 Display;
# 4 Sound; 5 Screenshot, Record, Caffeine, Clipboard; 6 Mirroring 2x1.
look material
setup python3 -I -c "import json,os;p=os.path.expanduser('~/.config/tessera/config.json');c=json.load(open(p));c.setdefault('controlCenter',{})['layout']=[];json.dump(c,open(p,'w'),indent=4)"
wait 2
ipc panels open controlCenter IRICE-TEST
wait 1
ptr move 1602 86 sleep 50 down sleep 1100 up
wait 0.6
shot wifijoinform-page
note scroll to 'Join other network…' (last row) and click it (from shot)
ptr scroll 0 15 sleep 200 scroll 0 15
shot list-bottom
note click 'Join other network…' then Join with nothing typed: 'Type the network name.'
key Test -k Return
wait 0.3
shot hidden-form
note security None/WPA/Enterprise; choose WPA/WPA2 (from shot)
note type 12345 in Password, Enter: 'Wi-Fi passwords are 8 to 63 characters.'
note Enterprise: EAP segmented; PEAP shows phase 2 + password; TLS shows certificate/key path fields
note Cancel: back to the list
ipc panels close
ipc panels open controlCenter IRICE-TEST
wait 1
ptr move 1602 86 sleep 50 down sleep 1100 up
wait 0.6
shot list-again
note the list (no form) after reopening
ipc panels close
